@BaseAddress = http://localhost:5286
@Token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Register Customer
POST {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@studio.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### 2. Login as Staff (Default Seeded Account)
POST {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@framerent.com",
  "password": "StaffPassword123!"
}

### 3. Get Active Equipment Catalog (Public)
GET {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/equipment
Accept: application/json

### 4. Check Equipment Availability (Public)
GET {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/equipment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/availability?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-05
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create Equipment (Staff Only)
POST {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/equipment
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RED V-Raptor 8K VV",
  "category": "Cameras",
  "description": "Flagship 8K Vista Vision cinema camera.",
  "dailyRate": 250.00,
  "totalStock": 2
}

### 6. Request Rental (Customer Only)
POST {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "quantity": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### 7. Top Rented Equipment Report (Staff Only)
GET {{BaseAddress}}/api/v1/reports/topequipment
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
